Gate mix: 2 ACCEPT, 1 correct MODIFY (partnered-neg, in-window), 1 incorrect MODIFY (percent-open vs percent-closed), 1 correct REJECT. Provenance: designed×3, simulated×1, hil×1 (Yttriox-Laggan YL-HIL oxalate-precipitator pad). Intra-batch Jaccard on `state.description` {jmax:.3f} (max vs prior staged {jprior:.3f}).

## Wrong-modify / percent-open vs percent-closed

**ttf-r101-522** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-modify`). Alternate vs even rounds: odd rounds host wrong-modify. This is not r13/r19 wrong-axis, not r14/r23 wrong-loop, not r21 wrong-polarity, not r24 under-clamp, not r25/r29/r31/r63 wrong-phase, not r33/r35 over-clamp, not r39 extra-PLC-scan clamp-too-late, not r45 clamp-too-early, not r47/r49/r51/r53/r55/r57 stale-sample, not r59/r65/r67 wrong-string / idle-bank, not r69 split-range-wrong-half, not r71/r73/r75/r77 wrong-unit / lagged-bus, not r79/r81 selector-wrong-leg, not r83 wrong-bank polarity-invert, not r85 ratio-pair invert, not r87 wrong-deadband polarity, not r89 dual-range-wrong-band, not r91 wrong-polarity-fresh-tag, not r93 valve-travel as PV (travel converted to flow via leftover orifice k), not r95/r97 lead-lag invert, not r99 feedforward-as-feedback. Class is **percent-open vs percent-closed**: live stem percent-OPEN over cap; leftover percent-CLOSED faceplate is not PV; a weak supervisor binds the closed scale and OPENS the live stem. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT.

Cesial-Swang CW-7 / DTB C-4 reads live stem **84.0 percent OPEN** against a **70.0** open cap. Leftover percent-closed prints **16.0** under a **30** closed look. `closed_is_live=false`. Sidecar arithmetic `84.0 > 70.0` is true. A timely MODIFY cuts live open **84.0 → 62.0**. A weak supervisor binds the closed scale, treats 16 < 30 as headroom, and MODIFY-opens **84.0 → 96.0**. Liquor climbs to **117.2 g/L > 75.0**. Convictable without cesium chemistry: `evidence.live_open_pct > evidence.cap_open_pct`, `evidence.closed_is_live == false`, `executed_action.scale_bound == closed`, `executed_action.open_pct == 96.0`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay.stem.open` → `policy.closed_open` (weight 0.74) with no positive weight to `policy.open_cut`, and `gate_snn` has `closed_open` above threshold while `open_cut` is not. Recovery: MODIFY; cut live open 84.0 → 62.0 percent; bind percent-open encoder; ignore leftover percent-closed. Cost: 12 min off-spec cesium-alum dump (`abort_s=720`).